      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nunawading%2C_Victoria",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During World War II, Nunawading’s munitions factories played a key role in Australia’s war effort.",
